flowchart LR
    I["Input materials + previous saved artifacts"] --> P["Model-generated proposal"]
    P --> T["Checks, transformations, storage decisions"]
    T --> S["Actual saved state"]
    S --> N["Input supplied to the next stage"]
    N --> U["Subsequent judgment and use"]
    P -. "Retain raw proposal" .-> A["Correspondence audit"]
    T -. "Log execution/inapplicability and transformations" .-> A
    S -. "Record saved contents" .-> A
    N -. "Match to parent record" .-> A
    U -. "Evaluate for the intended use" .-> A
